{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/785","id":4877362066,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQ07FcM8AAAABIrajkg","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/pull/785","diff_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/pull/785.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/schiste/Aethyme/pull/785.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/issues/785","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/785/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/785/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/issues/785/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/schiste/Aethyme/statuses/5e7fe7bf533ad269e03b8baa6e0afbfc38694f06","number":785,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(collaboration): add sensitive-response quarantine","user":{"login":"schiste","id":15890754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODkwNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15890754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nAdd a project-scoped Local sensitive-response path with a durable quarantine tombstone, managed-content inventory, and exact-path cleanup.\n\n## Source\n\nCheckpoint: `40100a42dfd72e444a8d29270802efd5373b11cf`. Schema 24 records incidents, tracked managed files and database tables, external export residuals, and cleanup receipts. Supported Local archive, capture, restore, generation, authority-history, and view paths are gated against a quarantined project. Cleanup keeps the project quarantined and reports legacy readers, views, exports, and unknown paths as residuals.\n\n## Validation\n\n`cargo check --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker` passed on this checkpoint; `git diff --check` passed. Focused behavior tests, old-binary compatibility check, mutation checks, and the disposable Playground drill are pending.\n\n## Limits\n\nThis work does not claim global erasure. External exports, Git copies, backups, process memory, already-open older readers, and preserved view generations remain explicit residuals; a permanent tombstone blocks future supported opens and ordinary resume.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-15T17:34:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T22:12:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c72d80af88e6957be50adb2b45dfd70051b5ab58","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"schiste:agent/implement-local-administrative-sensitive","ref":"agent/implement-local-administrative-sensitive","repo":{"id":1129235824,"node_id":"R_kgDOQ07FcA","name":"Aethyme","full_name":"schiste/Aethyme","owner":{"login":"schiste","id":15890754,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODkwNzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15890754?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste","html_url":"https://github.com/schiste","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schiste/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/schi